    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"\"]   11:11 A.M. 天气/小雨",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "11:11 A.M. 天气/小雨"
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[name=\"\"]   龙门中城区，三窗仔，木禾仓库外，",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "龙门中城区，三窗仔，木禾仓库外，"
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  大致侦查完毕。我们的观察点够隐蔽，仓库四周空无一人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "大致侦查完毕。我们的观察点够隐蔽，仓库四周空无一人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  大量堆砌的建材，荒废的建筑工地，拖动和摆放的痕迹很明显。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "大量堆砌的建材，荒废的建筑工地，拖动和摆放的痕迹很明显。"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  可以肯定整合运动已经布置了埋伏。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "可以肯定整合运动已经布置了埋伏。"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  老陈，你的线人是阿发。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "老陈，你的线人是阿发。"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  ......是。所以你还是听到了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "......是。所以你还是听到了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  我已经尽力不去听了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "我已经尽力不去听了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  我认识他很久很久，到今天为止至少十年。我不可能听不出来。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "我认识他很久很久，到今天为止至少十年。我不可能听不出来。"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  你是什么时候把他发展成线人的？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "你是什么时候把他发展成线人的？"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  他一年多前就感染了，从他营生的酒吧里忽然消失，留下他每天擦得干干净净的酒杯在那落灰。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "他一年多前就感染了，从他营生的酒吧里忽然消失，留下他每天擦得干干净净的酒杯在那落灰。"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  可能更早。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "可能更早。"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  至少这个，你应该告诉我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "至少这个，你应该告诉我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  可能要下雨了。立刻开始排查，把敌人从埋伏点轰出来。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "可能要下雨了。立刻开始排查，把敌人从埋伏点轰出来。"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  ——唉。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "——唉。"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  来不及。他没剩下多少血可流。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "来不及。他没剩下多少血可流。"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  我去吸引火力，把所有整合运动都引出来。你们包围他们，结束这场战斗。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "我去吸引火力，把所有整合运动都引出来。你们包围他们，结束这场战斗。"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  很危险。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "很危险。"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  这样做是最快的。这一次，你可以信任我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "这样做是最快的。这一次，你可以信任我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  我一直都信任你。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我一直都信任你。"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  按星熊督察说的部署。动作快。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "按星熊督察说的部署。动作快。"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_015_lmg\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"近卫局成员\"]  是！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "近卫局成员",
        "content": "是！"
    },
